    <p class="lede max-w-2xl">We work with owner-run businesses in {% for area in site.areas %}{{ area }}{% if not loop.last %}{% if loop.index == site.areas.length - 1 %} and {% else %}, {% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %} and the towns around them. Below are the kinds of businesses we built our packages for, and the headaches that tend to come with each.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-gray-700">The projects listed are typical places to start. They are examples of what we might do, not results we promise. Every business is different, so we scope yours after we talk.</p>
