</section>

<section class="section pt-0 md:pt-0" aria-label="Business types we serve">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      {% for a in audiences %}
      <article id="{{ a.id }}" class="card scroll-mt-24">
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900">{{ a.name }}</h2>

        <h3 class="mt-5 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">Common headaches</h3>
        <ul class="mt-2 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-800">
          {% for pain in a.pains %}
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-medium text-gray-700">&bull;</span><span>{{ pain }}</span></li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>

        <h3 class="mt-5 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">Typical first projects</h3>
        <ul class="mt-2 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-800">
          {% for win in a.wins %}
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-medium text-indigo-700">&#10003;</span><span>{{ win }}</span></li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-gray-50" aria-labelledby="dont-see-heading">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <h2 id="dont-see-heading" class="h-section mb-4">Don't see your business?</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-800">Most local businesses share the same handful of tech problems: a website that is hard to use on a phone, slow replies to new customers, a Google listing that is out of date, and software that doesn't talk to other software. If that sounds like you, we can probably help, whatever you sell.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-gray-800">Tell us what you do on the <a href="/contact/" class="link">contact page</a> and we will say honestly whether we are a good fit.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section band-dark on-dark text-center">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
